# The Emissary in Northern San d'Oria at status 7 with the letter to the consuls (the mission current): Shakir plays
# 556; Helaku plays 537, whose finish with option 1 (not 0) does nothing and with option 0 ends The Emissary, begins
# The Emissary Sandoria 2, takes the letter and moves to status 8. Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login
# plays Rumors from the West, 878.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Baraka/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/537 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/581
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=36,-2,-2 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissary current
keyitem LetterToTheConsulsBastok
login
missionstatus Bastok 7
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
trigger Helaku
finish option=1
trigger Helaku
finish option=0
